WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.100
magnificent destiny.

00:02.100 --> 00:06.180
Everybody in this room is a part of it in your own way.

00:06.180 --> 00:09.340
Each of us inherits the deeds and the myths,

00:09.340 --> 00:12.480
the triumphs, the legacies of our own heroes and founders

00:12.480 --> 00:14.980
who so bravely showed us the way.

00:14.980 --> 00:18.520
Our ancestors gave everything for homelands

00:18.520 --> 00:23.360
that they defended with pride, with sweat,

00:23.360 --> 00:26.760
with blood, with life, and with death.

00:26.760 --> 00:29.620
Now the righteous task of protecting the nations

00:29.620 --> 00:33.560
that they built belongs to each and every one of us.

